************************************************************************
.SCREEN	1	Landing Site

.MSG
You stand at the top of a mountain, your gunship is next to you. Towards
the east, you can see a cave entrance.
.ENDMSG

.BTN	2	Examine the Ship
.BTN	3	Enter the Cave

************************************************************************
.SCREEN	2	Gunship

.MSG
You enter your gunship. You find some of your equipment. You wonder why
you can't remember where the rest of your weapons are.

- You equip Morph Module.
- You equip Missile Launcher (30).
- You equip Power Beam.

You head towards the cave entrance.
.ENDMSG

.BTN	3	Enter the Cave

************************************************************************
.SCREEN	3	Cave Entrance

.MSG
You stand at the entrance of a cave. The sunlight pours through numerous
holes in the walls.

There is a small frog-like creature hopping in a corner.
.ENDMSG

.BTN	4	Attack the creature
.BTN	5	Avoid the creature

************************************************************************
.SCREEN	4	Cave Entrance

.MSG
You attack the frog-like creature using your beam, as it hops
aggressively around the cave.

Finally, a well placed shot evaporates it, without leaving any trace.
.ENDMSG

.BTN	6	Continue

************************************************************************
.SCREEN	5	Cave Entrance

.MSG
You avoid the creature.

It doesn't seem to feel your presence.
.ENDMSG

.BTN	6	Continue

************************************************************************
.SCREEN	6	Cave

.MSG
You stand at a dead end.

There's a small hole in one of the cave walls, about 1 meter of
diameter.

What do you do?
.ENDMSG

.BTN	7	Try to enlarge the hole with missiles
.BTN	8	Use the morph module to go through

************************************************************************
.SCREEN	7	Small passage

.MSG
You shoot a missile, and part of the wall collapses.

Once the dust settles, you advance through the debris safely.
.ENDMSG

.BTN	9	Continue

************************************************************************
.SCREEN	8	Small passage

.MSG
You activate your morph module, and enter the small passage. At first,
you're amazed by how conveniently shaped the passage is.

Before you can react, a loose boulder falls, impeding your pass. As you
try to hastily backtrack, the passage collapses. Maybe spelunking in
such a small place was a bad idea after all.

You feel the energy from you armor suit slowly draining.
.ENDMSG

.BTN	OVER	Continue

************************************************************************
.SCREEN	9	Magma room

.MSG
As you progress through the cave system, you see a pool of bright orange
liquid that looks like magma. Scans indicate that it's a very dangerous
substance.

For some reason, you feel this place will be important later.

- You will remember this place.
.ENDMSG

.BTN	15	Continue
